// session-progress-run.bml — the progression across every measured session, read from the ledger and nothing else:
// day by day, then all, the earlier half of the sessions against the later, and the best day (rented requests, output,
// cache read, every rented token; local tokens generated; two shares in parts per million: `share ppm` against the rented
// output alone, `total ppm` against every rented token, the RENT docs/rent-to-zero-goal.form defines). It measures
// nothing and writes nothing; observe/session-rent-run.bml is the door that fills the ledger. Run from the repo root.
// preludes: form-stdlib/bml/session-progress.bml
section [form.bml] {
    sp-print(sp-progress-lines());
}
